     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><div>Hello, there </div><div><br></div><div>The ggtree is correctly installed in the following way:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><div>source(&quot;<a href=\"https://bioconductor.org/biocLite.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://bioconductor.org/biocLite.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482979952000&amp;usg=AOvVaw09LDO9xhWIpg5dfY4fwmvB\">https://bioconductor.org/biocLite.R</a>&quot;)</div><div>biocLite(c(&quot;GenomicFeatures&quot;, &quot;AnnotationDbi&quot;))</div><div>biocLite(&quot;ggtree&quot;)<br></div></span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><div><font color=\"#660066\">set.seed(2015-12-21)</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">tree = rtree(30)</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">p &lt;- ggtree(tree) + xlim(NA, 6)</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">p+geom_cladelabel(node=45, label=&quot;test label&quot;) +</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">        geom_cladelabel(node=34, label=&quot;another clade&quot;) </font></div></div></code></div><div><br></div><font color=\"#ff0000\">&gt;Error: could not find function &quot;geom_cladelabel&quot;</font></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><font color=\"#660066\">source(&#39;~/Downloads/geom_cladelabel.R&#39;)</font></div></code></div><br>Then it works at last<br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Is there a way to source all the functions needed in ggtree?<br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Thanks.</div><div><br></div><div>Ming</div><div><br></div><div><br><